{"suttaId":"tha-ap54","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3968,4004],"vripara":"8"},"segments":{"tha-ap54:0.3":"Sataraṃsittheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap54:1.1":"“Ubbiddhaṃ selamāruyha,","tha-ap54:1.2":"nisīdi purisuttamo;","tha-ap54:1.3":"Pabbatassāvidūramhi,","tha-ap54:1.4":"brāhmaṇo mantapāragū.","tha-ap54:2.1":"“Upaviṭṭhaṃ mahāvīraṃ,","tha-ap54:2.2":"devadevaṃ narāsabhaṃ;","tha-ap54:2.3":"Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna,","tha-ap54:2.4":"santhaviṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap54:3.1":"“‘Esa buddho mahāvīro,","tha-ap54:3.2":"varadhammappakāsako;","tha-ap54:3.3":"Jalati aggikhandhova,","tha-ap54:3.4":"bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhato.","tha-ap54:4.1":"“‘Mahāsamuddova ‘kkhubbho [’ kkhobho (sī. syā.)],","tha-ap54:4.2":"aṇṇavova duruttaro;","tha-ap54:4.3":"Migarājāvasambhīto [chambhito (ka.)],","tha-ap54:4.4":"dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā’.","tha-ap54:5.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya,","tha-ap54:5.2":"padumuttaranāyako;","tha-ap54:5.3":"Bhikkhusaṅghe ṭhito satthā,","tha-ap54:5.4":"imā gāthā abhāsatha.","tha-ap54:6.1":"“‘Yenāyaṃ [yenāhaṃ (ka.)] añjalī dinno,","tha-ap54:6.2":"buddhaseṭṭho ca thomito;","tha-ap54:6.3":"Tiṃsakappasahassāni,","tha-ap54:6.4":"devarajjaṃ karissati.","tha-ap54:7.1":"“‘Kappasatasahassamhi,","tha-ap54:7.2":"aṅgīrasasanāmako;","tha-ap54:7.3":"Vivaṭṭacchado [vivatthacchaddo (sī.)] sambuddho,","tha-ap54:7.4":"uppajjissati tāvade.","tha-ap54:8.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādo,","tha-ap54:8.2":"oraso dhammanimmito;","tha-ap54:8.3":"Sataraṃsīti nāmena,","tha-ap54:8.4":"arahā so bhavissati’.","tha-ap54:9.1":"“Jātiyā sattavassohaṃ,","tha-ap54:9.2":"pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","tha-ap54:9.3":"Sataraṃsimhi nāmena,","tha-ap54:9.4":"pabhā niddhāvate mama.","tha-ap54:10.1":"“Maṇḍape rukkhamūle vā,","tha-ap54:10.2":"jhāyī jhānarato ahaṃ;","tha-ap54:10.3":"Dhāremi antimaṃ dehaṃ,","tha-ap54:10.4":"sammāsambuddhasāsane.","tha-ap54:11.1":"“Saṭṭhikappasahassamhi,","tha-ap54:11.2":"caturo rāmanāmakā;","tha-ap54:11.3":"Sattaratanasampannā,","tha-ap54:11.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap54:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap54:12.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap54:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sataraṃsi thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap54:14.1":"Sataraṃsittherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2556,"to":2557,"paras":[{"para":2556,"vripara":"8-9","refs":["tha-ap54:1"],"lines":["8-9. So “ahaṃ kena kammena sattavassikova santipadaṃ anuppattosmī”ti saramāno pubbakammaṃ ñāṇena paccakkhato disvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ udānavasena pakāsento <b>ucciyaṃ selamāruyhā</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>ucciyan</b>ti uccaṃ selamayaṃ pabbataṃ āruyha nisīdi padumuttaroti sambandho.","<b>Pabbatassāvidūramhī</b>ti bhagavato nisinnassa pabbatassa āsannaṭṭhāneti attho.","<b>Brāhmaṇo mantapāragū</b>ti mantasaṅkhātassa vedattayassa pāraṃ pariyosānaṃ koṭiṃ gato eko brāhmaṇoti attho, aññaṃ viya attānaṃ niddisati ayaṃ mantapāragūti.","<b>Upaviṭṭhaṃ mahāvīran</b>ti tasmiṃ pabbate nisinnaṃ vīravantaṃ jinaṃ, kiṃ visiṭṭhaṃ?","<b>Devadevaṃ</b> sakalachakāmāvacarabrahmadevānaṃ atidevaṃ <b>narāsabhaṃ</b> narānaṃ āsataṃ seṭṭhaṃ <b>lokanāyakaṃ</b> sakalasattalokaṃ nayantaṃ nibbānaṃ pāpentaṃ ahaṃ <b>añjaliṃ</b> dasanakhasamodhānañjalipuṭaṃ sirasi muddhani <b>paggahetvāna</b> patiṭṭhapetvā <b>santhaviṃ</b> suṭṭhuṃ thomesinti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap54:1"],["tha-ap54:1"],["tha-ap54:1"],["tha-ap54:1"],["tha-ap54:1"],["tha-ap54:1"]]},{"para":2557,"vripara":"12","refs":["tha-ap54:5"],"lines":["<b>Abhāsathā</b>ti “yenāyaṃ añjalī dinno … pe … arahā so bhavissatī”ti byākāsi.","Sesaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap54:5"],["tha-ap54:5"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap54:1.3","pabbatassāvidūramhī",0,2],["tha-ap54:1.3","brāhmaṇo mantapāragū",0,3],["tha-ap54:5.3","abhāsathā",1,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
